# fm (IRIX file manager) palette: blue-grey glass, accent #0a84ff. Derived from WhiteSurLiquidDark.
# Window/Header 30,32,41 = fm's glass over the blurred wallpaper (headers are the same glass, no grey bar);
# View 24,26,34; Button 58,61,72 = fm's pill; Tooltip 36,39,49 = fm's sidebar tint (same as GTK menus).
# Secondary/inactive text 154,156,163 = fm's white .55 over the glass. Text on the blue selection is
# white with light tints for links/negative/neutral/positive so they stay readable on #0a84ff.
